-- NorthstarIQ — Lifecycle transition policy, as deployed
--
-- ⚠️ NEW REPRODUCIBILITY ARTIFACT, created 2026-08-27 alongside the metadata
-- it verifies. It was NOT used during any earlier validation, because neither
-- it nor the Custom Metadata type existed before this increment.
--
-- Purpose: re-run this to confirm the governed allowed-transition policy in
-- the org matches force-app/main/default/customMetadata/Lifecycle_Transition.*.
-- Expected on 2026-08-27: 10 rows, every Is_Active__c true, every
-- Rule_Version__c v1.0.
--
-- This type is the SINGLE executable definition of an allowed Lead lifecycle
-- transition. The future preventive safeguard in Lead_Inbound_Before_Save and
-- the future NorthstarIQ detective control will both read these same records.
-- A transition absent from this result is not allowed: the policy is a
-- whitelist, so silence is a refusal rather than an omission.
--
-- Read-only. Safe to run against any org.

SELECT DeveloperName,
       MasterLabel,
       From_Stage__c,
       To_Stage__c,
       Is_Active__c,
       Rule_Version__c
FROM Lifecycle_Transition__mdt
ORDER BY From_Stage__c, To_Stage__c
